{"Title":"An Act authorizing the city of Greenfield to grant an additional liquor license for the sale of all alcohol beverages to be drunk on the premises ","BillNumber":"H4035","DocketNumber":"HD4475","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"NMB1","Name":"Natalie M. Blais","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NMB1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-17T10:34:34.847"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"NMB1","Name":"Natalie M. Blais","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NMB1","ResponseDate":"2023-07-17T10:34:34.8466667"},{"Id":"JMC0","Name":"Joanne M. Comerford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JMC0","ResponseDate":"2023-08-02T15:21:43.2033333"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"JMC0","Name":"Joanne M. Comerford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JMC0","ResponseDate":"2023-07-17T10:34:34.847"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4035/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Blais of Deerfield and Senator Comerford, a joint petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4035) of Natalie M. Blais and Joanne M. Comerford (with the approval of the mayor and city council) that the city of Greenfield be authorized to grant an additional license for the sale of all alcoholic beverages to be drunk on the premises in said city.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding Section 17 of Chapter 138 of the General Laws or any other General or Special Laws to the contrary, the licensing authority of the City of Greenfield may grant one additional license for the sale of all alcohol beverages to be drunk on the premises under Section 12 of said Chapter 138 to Tuckerman's Glasses, LLC DBA Greenfield Garden Cinema, located at 361 Main Street, Greenfield. \r\n\tSECTION 2. The licenses issued pursuant to this Act shall be nontransferable to any other locations.\r\n\tSECTION 3. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}